sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 普通用户
    participant UI as Detail / Orders
    participant API as frontend/src/api.ts
    participant Ctrl as ApiControllers
    participant Catalog as CatalogService
    participant Order as OrderWorkflowService
    participant Store as DemoStore
    User->>UI: 查看可购买团购套餐
    UI->>API: GET /merchants/{id}
    API->>Ctrl: 查询商家详情
    Ctrl->>Catalog: merchantDetail(id)
    Catalog->>Store: 读取 active GroupDeal
    Store-->>UI: 套餐、价格和库存
    User->>UI: 提交数量并购买
    UI->>API: POST /orders/group-buy
    API->>Ctrl: 创建团购订单
    Ctrl->>Order: createGroupOrder(current,dealId,quantity)
    Order->>Store: 校验状态/数量并保存 PENDING_PAYMENT
    User->>UI: 发起模拟支付
    UI->>API: POST /payments(orderId,clientRequestId)
    API->>Ctrl: 支付请求
    Ctrl->>Order: pay(current,orderId,clientRequestId)
    Order->>Store: 幂等扣库存、置 PAID、生成 couponCode
    Store-->>UI: 同一订单与券码
    alt 套餐停用、库存不足或数量非法
        Order-->>UI: 返回 400/409，订单和库存不变
    end
